description=[OxygenOS 16 / MT2111 ONLY] Switch A2DP SOURCE (normal output) <-> SINK (receiver) on OnePlus 9RT. WebUI with dynamic mode toggle and SINK-only restart. In-module updates supported. APatch/Magisk. Use at your own risk.
